# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for host-parallel CPUs (SMP.adoc "S4").
# Guest memory is shared host memory that CPU threads read and write without locks, as the
# hardware's CPUs do; races there are the guest's to order (with LL/SC and SYNC).
race:ultraviolent::detail::load_word
race:ultraviolent::detail::store_word
race:ultraviolent::load_unsigned
race:ultraviolent::store_unsigned
